Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}All right. Dungeon Family
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}or Wu-Tang Clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}よし　Dungeon Familyか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}Wu-Tang Clanか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Oh, you know, see, it's ungodly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}いや、それは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}比べるもんじゃないって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:10.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Wu-Tang, Wu-Tang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:10.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Wu-Tang、Wu-Tang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:10.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}What? Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:10.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}は？マジかよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:12.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}This is like Tony Starks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:12.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Tony Starksだぜ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}This is the drip. You
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}これがファッションなんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}わかる？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But I got to say, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Wu-Tang videos had me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でもさ、Wu-TangのMVのせいで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}spending a lot more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}money than I needed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}必要以上に金使っちまったんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Me and Don C was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}buying new Timbs,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺とDon Cで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}新品のティンバーランドにダウンに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:28.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}new puffer jackets, fitted hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:28.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}white tees, Wallabees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:28.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}キャップに白T、Wallabeesまで買ってた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And then, because it looked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}like every day was a video.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}だって毎日がMVみたいに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}見えてたからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:35.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And I got to, like, New York
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:35.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and I seen dirty Timbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:35.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}で、New Yorkに着いたら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:35.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}みんな汚れたティンバーランド履いてんの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I called Free up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Freeに電話して
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:41.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I said, I didn't know ni**as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:41.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}had dirty Timbs in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:41.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「NYの奴らが汚れたティンバーランド
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:41.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}履いてるなんて知らなかったぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:43.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I just spent all this money
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:43.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}on my fresh Timbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:43.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}新品にこんだけ金かけたのに」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I couldn't let my Timbs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}go more than three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺は3日以上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}同じティンバーランド履けなかったからな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.45,0:00:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}If my Timbs got a scuff on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.45,0:00:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}them, I'm in the meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.45,0:00:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ティンバーランドに傷がついたら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.45,0:00:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}会議中でも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.19,0:00:52.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}meeting adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.19,0:00:52.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I need a new pair of Timbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.19,0:00:52.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「会議は中断
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.19,0:00:52.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}新しいティンバーランド買ってくる」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:53.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:53.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}「すぐ戻る」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:55.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And I carried the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:55.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Timbs in a plastic bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:55.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}で、ティンバーランドを
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:55.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ビニール袋に入れて持ってきて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:00:56.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Put them on in the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:00:56.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}会議中に履き替えて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:00:57.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Now let's continue the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:00:57.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}「さあ、話の続きをしよう」ってな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:01:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, yeah, yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:01:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}No, I was like the DJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:01:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}なるほどな　オッケー
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:01:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}いや、DJの番だと思って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Well, I got to do the DJ...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}You got to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}DJの番だろ…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}お前がやれよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:03.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm sorry. You're correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:03.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ごめん、その通りだわ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:10.03,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}Dungeon Family：OutKastらを擁する
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:10.03,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1218)\fs40}アトランタの音楽集団
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:10.03,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1266)\fs40}Wu-Tang Clan：ニューヨークの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:10.03,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1314)\fs40}伝説的ヒップホップ集団
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:17.68,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}Tony Starks：Wu-Tang Clanの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:17.68,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1218)\fs40}Ghostface Killahの別名
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:28.81,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1170)\fs40}Don C：Yeの長年の友人でデザイナー
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:28.81,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1218)\fs40}Wallabees：Clarksの靴。Wu-Tangの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:28.81,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1266)\fs40}メンバーの愛用で有名
